// Something a build does, as compiling, by name: kiln compile runs the task compile, after those it
// depends on, each once. A task part of another runs before it, as if that depended on it: a
// plugin's task part of check, as a test is, runs when check does, and so when build does.
type Task(name: String, description: String, dependsOn: List<String> = [], partOf: List<String> = [], action: @Building (Build) -> Unit)
